
[l_english.FOCUS_C12_ADJUST_EXPORT_SHARE]
Adjust export share

[l_english.FOCUS_C12_ADJUST_EXPORT_SHARE_desc]
The economy of Rock Farm relies heavily on exports — the vast majority of which are supplied to the Empire, only to be turned into the very bullets and guns fired back at us.\nWe need to adjust our export ratios and actively expand markets outside the Empire, even though this means giving up part of our current market share and suffering many short-term economic setbacks.

[l_english.FOCUS_C12_ADJUST_EXPORT_SHARE_TOOLTIP]
A series of resolutions will be unlocked, we need to open up §C trade channels beyond the  Empire §! to ensure the stability of the farm

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_ADJUST_EXPORT_SHARE]
调整出口份额

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_ADJUST_EXPORT_SHARE_desc]
采石农场的经济非常依赖出口，而绝大多数提供给了帝国，并且最终将变成打回在我们身上的弹药和枪支。我们需要调整我们的出口比例，并积极开拓帝国外的市场，虽然这意味着将让出我们现有的市场份额，并且在短时间内对经济造成许多负面影响。

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_ADJUST_EXPORT_SHARE_TOOLTIP]
一系列决议将解锁，我们需要开拓§C帝国之外的贸易渠道§!来确保采石农场的稳定
